fc2mp4 downloads and runs a patched build of Fightcade's FB Neo emulator
(https://github.com/fightcadeorg/fightcade-fbneo). That emulator, and the patches to it in the
emulator/ folder, are also subject to the FB Neo license
(https://github.com/finalburnneo/FBNeo/blob/master/src/license.txt) and, through FB Neo, to the MAME
license.

